                    <img src="{!$Resource.GigacommBusinessPageAsset + '/phone.png'}" class="img-fluid gc-img-rounded" />
                </div>
                
                <div class="slds-col slds-large-size_7-of-12 slds-small-size_12-of-12 slds-m-top_large slds-m-bottom_small slds-p-around_x-large">
                    <h1 class="gc-order-wizard-section-title gc-default-color">
                        Better Communication for better business
                    </h1>
                    
                    <p>
                        Gigacomm’s hosted voice solutions will help you improve your business productivity and bottom line. Our phone packages are scalable, easy to manage and will support your business as it grows.<br/>&nbsp;<br/>

					Incorporating the latest Voice over Internet Protocol (VoIP) technology – a phone service delivered over the internet – 
                        we remove the frustrations of analogue phone services. No more on-site PBX equipment, managing outdated hardware or
                        spending thousands in ongoing maintenance costs.
                    </p>
                    <!-- <p class="gc-default-color    ">
                        <strong>Which is why we created the Gigacomm Guarantee  </strong>   
                    </p> -->
                    
                </div>
                
            </div>
        
        
